{"step_index":1107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T19:42:46Z","content":"A technical system architecture document with flowcharts has been created at [`architecture.md`](file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2/architecture.md).\n\n---\n\n### 1. High-Level End-to-End System Architecture\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph INGESTION[\"1. INGESTION & DATA SOURCES\"]\n        A1[\"Camera Feed / Product Surface Images\"]\n        A2[\"Rockwell Arena Simulation Data (.csv / .xlsx)\"]\n        A3[\"MATLAB Neural Models (.m / 3000Samplesv3.mat)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph INFERENCE[\"2. DUAL INFERENCE & PROCESSING PIPELINES\"]\n        B1[\"YOLOv8-cls Deep Neural Classifier\"]\n        B2[\"Grad-CAM Explainability Engine\"]\n        B3[\"Dynamic Telemetry & TOC Analyzer\"]\n        B4[\"Pure-Python ANN Surrogate Engine\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph REASONING[\"3. DECISION & CAUSAL INTELLIGENCE CORE\"]\n        C1[\"Defect Registry & OOD Novelty Filter\"]\n        C2[\"Theory of Constraints Bottleneck Engine\"]\n        C3[\"Root-Cause Causal Matrix (Process <-> Defect)\"]\n        C4[\"Financial Loss Waterfall & What-If Engine\"]\n        C5[\"Prescriptive Capacity Optimizer (<0.05ms)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph UI_LAYER[\"4. EXECUTIVE MISSION CONTROL COCKPIT\"]\n        D1[\"Tab 1: Quality Inspection Gallery & CAM Overlays\"]\n        D2[\"Tab 2: Plant Process Flow SCADA Topology\"]\n        D3[\"Tab 3: Root Cause Evidence & Defect Drift\"]\n        D4[\"Tab 4: Profitability & ROI Simulator\"]\n        D5[\"Tab 5: Digital Twin Metamodel & Gauges\"]\n    end\n\n    A1 --> B1\n    B1 --> B2\n    B2 --> C1\n    \n    A2 --> B3\n    B3 --> C2\n    \n    A3 --> B4\n    B4 --> C5\n\n    C1 --> C3\n    C2 --> C3\n    C2 --> C4\n    C1 --> C4\n\n    C1 --> D1\n    C2 --> D2\n    C3 --> D3\n    C4 --> D4\n    C5 --> D5\n    B4 --> D5\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Core Subsystems Breakdown\n\n#### Subsystem A: Computer Vision & Explainability\n- **YOLOv8 Classifier**: High-speed multi-class defect classification (`crack`, `scratch`, `rust`, `hole`, `normal`).\n- **Grad-CAM Backpropagation**: Generates visual activation heatmaps to highlight exact defect locations.\n- **Out-of-Distribution (OOD) Filter**: Automatically flags low-confidence or novel signatures for human review.\n\n#### Subsystem B: Process Flow & Theory of Constraints (TOC)\n- **Dynamic Telemetry Parser**: Discovers station columns across arbitrary simulation topologies (Models 1, 2, 3).\n- **Mathematical Bottleneck Finder**: Evaluates $\\text{argmax}(\\text{utilization})$ to isolate the primary constraint.\n- **Little's Law Engine**: Calculates work-in-progress (WIP) buffer accumulation.\n\n#### Subsystem C: Neural Metamodel Digital Twin (MATLAB ANN Surrogate)\n- **Mathematical Forward-Pass**:\n\n$$\\hat{y} = \\text{mapminmax}^{-1}\\Big(b_2 + LW_{2,1} \\cdot \\tanh(b_1 + IW_{1,1} \\cdot \\text{mapminmax}(x))\\Big)$$\n\n- **Sub-Millisecond Speed**: Evaluates 13 neural network models in **under 0.05 ms** (over $1000\\times$ faster than stochastic Arena runs).\n- **Prescriptive Optimizer**: Solves for maximum throughput without exceeding the 85% bottleneck safety limit.\n\n#### Subsystem D: Root-Cause Causal Matrix\n- Dynamically correlates **upstream machine overloads / queue build-up** with **downstream physical defect manifestations**.\n\n#### Subsystem E: Financial Waterfall & What-If Simulator\n- Translates engineering constraints into dollar metrics: **Gross Revenue**, **Scrap Loss**, **Idle Time Cost**, **Opportunity Loss**, and **Net Margin**.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Latency & Technology Overview\n\n| Subsystem | Core Technology | Latency |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Surface Inspection** | Ultralytics YOLOv8, PyTorch | ~12 ms |\n| **Explainable Heatmap** | OpenCV, Grad-CAM Engine | ~18 ms |\n| **TOC Diagnostics** | Pandas, NumPy | ~2 ms |\n| **Digital Twin (ANN)** | Pure-Python Vectorized NumPy | **&lt; 0.05 ms** |\n| **Causal Inference** | Rule Engine + Physics of Failure | ~1 ms |\n| **Financial Engine** | Loss Waterfall Sensitivity Solver | &lt; 0.5 ms |\n| **User Interface** | Streamlit, Plotly, CSS3 Glassmorphism | 60 FPS |"}
